    "title": [
        "Evan's Home Tour (1)",
        "埃文的家之参观（1）"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Welcome!",
                "欢迎！"
            ],
            [
                "My name is Evan, and I'm your homestay host.",
                "我叫埃文，我是你的寄宿家庭主人。"
            ],
            [
                "I would like to show you around my house today.",
                "今天我想带你参观我的房子。"
            ],
            [
                "I live here with my wife Luna, my daughter Mia, and my son James.",
                "我和我的妻子露娜、女儿米娅以及儿子詹姆斯住在这里。"
            ],
            [
                "Now we're at the gate.",
                "现在我们到了大门口。"
            ],
            [
                "You can see the garden, where we plant many flowers.",
                "你可以看到花园，我们在那里种了许多花。"
            ],
            [
                "The garage is on the left.",
                "车库在左边。"
            ],
            [
                "That's also the place we keep large rubbish bins.",
                "那也是我们放大型垃圾桶的地方。"
            ],
            [
                "Open the door and walk in, and we're now standing at the front hall.",
                "打开门走进去，我们现在站在门厅里。"
            ],
            [
                "On the ground floor, there's a large living room.",
                "在一楼有一个大客厅。"
            ],
            [
                "My wife likes these floor-to-ceiling windows because they can make more natural light get in.",
                "我的妻子喜欢这些落地窗，因为它们可以让更多的自然光照进来。"
            ],
            [
                "The sitting area has a cosy sofa, a couple of chairs, and a soft carpet.",
                "休息区有一个舒适的沙发、几把椅子和一张柔软的地毯。"
            ],
            [
                "Mia and James usually sit on the carpet to read.",
                "米娅和詹姆斯通常坐在地毯上看书。"
            ],
            [
                "Luna and I decided to put a bookcase instead of a television in our living room because we believe that reading is better for our kids than watching TV.",
                "露西和我决定在客厅放一个书柜而不是电视，因为我们相信阅读对孩子们来说比看电视更好。"
            ],
            [
                "We have various reading time every week and you're welcome to join.",
                "我们每周有固定的阅读时间，欢迎你参加。"
            ],
            [
                "In winter, when the temperature outside is low, it is very lovely to enjoy a book beside the fireplace.",
                "在冬天，当外面气温很低时，在壁炉旁读书是很惬意的事。"
            ],
            [
                "The kitchen is certainly my favourite place in the house.",
                "厨房当然是我在这所房子里最喜欢的地方。"
            ],
            [
                "I love cooking.",
                "我喜欢烹饪。"
            ],
            [
                "We have various cooking tools and equipment.",
                "我们有各种烹饪工具和设备。"
            ],
            [
                "The oven and the fridge are a little bit old, but they're still working well.",
                "烤箱和冰箱有点旧了，但它们仍然运转良好。"
            ],
            [
                "Plates and cups are in these drawers and cupboards.",
                "盘子和杯子在这些抽屉和橱柜里。"
            ],
            [
                "We don't use the dining room very often.",
                "我们不太经常使用餐厅。"
            ],
            [
                "Only when we have guests do we use it.",
                "只有当有客人时我们才会使用它。"
            ]
        ]
    },
